# api/

`api/openapi.yaml` lives here: the authoritative transport contract for this
application's JSON API. It is hand-edited, and both the Go server bindings
(`internal/platform/httpapi/openapigen/`) and the TypeScript models
(`frontend/src/lib/api/schema.d.ts`) are generated from it.

This directory is empty today. `{{.AppName}}` has no HTTP API yet: the
OpenAPI document, the generated bindings, and the typed frontend client
arrive with the API milestone. The router that will mount them is
`internal/platform/httpapi/router.go`, which marks the mount point in a
comment.
